WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.230
Welcome

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.230
to the after-party for
our 2nd TV series run

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.580
We’re at the o…

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.250
At last!

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.730
At last!!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.060
Mahiro-san! Good work on the second season of our TV series!

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.400
What’re you even talking about?

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.340
That finale sure had us in a bind!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.250
And what finale would that be?

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.640
A world ruled by the Banshin.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.700
Constantly in fear of eradication, mankind surrounded itself with a truly massive wall.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.280
You’re not even getting it right!

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.820
Didn’t you guys defeat that thing?

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.300
That was to make certain your safety…

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.290
That’s right, Mahiro-kun!

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.520
That’s water under the bridge now!

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.760
Come now, Mahiro-san. Let’s rejuvenate ourselves in these springs!

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:49.680
H-Hey!

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.180
Let’s soak in these dried springs until we turn to prunes!

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.940
It’s not "dried" (shinabita), but "rustic" (hinabita)!

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:00.060
I’ve told you this before, haven’t I?!

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.390
Haiyori masu ka? Sei no uneri!
Shall we creep? Wave of life!

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:15.530
SAN chi PINCHI
Sanity Pinch

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.820
Dare da? Jama suru na my my love
Who is it? Don't interfere with my my love.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.540
Asaki fukaki mono domo yo
You shallow yet deep ones.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.120
Dare da? Mamori nuke my my love
Who is it? I must protect my my love

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.690
Uma ga kerishi mono domo yo
You, who've met a horse's rear end

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:30.690
Risei ga chigireru shunkan
At the moment all reason crumbles...

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:30.690
SAN chi PINCHI
Sanity Pinch

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.740
Genkai mitai dayo?
It looks like you've reached your limit.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.740
SAN chi PINCHI
Sanity Pinch

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.740
Risei ga buttobu shunkan
At the moment all reason gets blown away...

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.740
SAN chi PINCHI
Sanity Pinch

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.970
Anata wa nigerarenai!
There's nowhere for you to run!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.970
Nigasanai!
I won't let you go!

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:43.140
Sou da! Jama suru na bye bye LIFE
That's right! Those who interfere can say bye bye life.

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:45.960
Sane yo Kurau mono domo yo
Be gone, those who devour.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:49.300
Sou da! Akirameru na bye bye LIFE
That's right! Don't give up, bye bye life.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.960
Omochi yakishi mono domo yo
You ones who cook mochi.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.540
"ANO KO hoshii yo" "Agenai"
"I want that person." "I won't give them up."

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:58.180
Kagome kagome uchuu shiki
Ring around the rosy, galaxy ceremony

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.180
Ushiro no maushiro
Behind you, right behind you

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:04.520
ANO KO kudasai Muri yari ubaitai no ga ai no honnou sa
Give me that person, please. Wanting to steal by force is the instinct of love.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.140
Mate mate? Yada yada yada
Wait, wait?! NONONO!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.140
Nya!
Meow!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.980
Koi wa KAOSU no shimobe nari
Love is the servant of chaos.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.210
Arawareshi watashi wa daare?
Who am I who has appeared?

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:13.210
SAN chi PINCHI!
Sanity Pinch!

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:16.150
Koi wa KAOSU no shimobe nari
Love is the servant of chaos.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:19.470
Erabareshi kimi no kami desu yo
I am the god of you, the chosen one.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:19.470
SAN chi PINCHI!
Sanity Pinch!

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:22.680
RABU wo KURAFUTO Tatakai nagara ne
As I fight to craft love,

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.350
To ka nantoka ittemo hontou wa konna ni konna ni daisuki
Well, no matter what I say, I really love you this this this much!

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:30.120
Haiyori masu ka? Sei no uneri!
Shall we creep? Wave of life!

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:32.780
Welcome, dear guests.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:36.180
My! What a quaint resort we have here!

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:40.160
It’s <i>you guys</i>  again?!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.460
That should be our reaction…

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:45.060
What’re you doing here, Luhy-san?

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.390
Well…

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:51.150
I took on a summer job at this inn, and another at a beach house.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.480
So that’s why!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.770
That's awesome!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.020
These days, many come here wishing to be rejuvenated by our springs,

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:02.280
or merely are in search of the sense of amusement our baths offer.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.660
Please enjoy your stay to your hearts’ content.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.960
How nice does that sound!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.820
A tragically legendary onsen?

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.540
They’ve even got mixed bathing…

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:18.100
All right, Mahiro-san! Let’s head on in and start the healing!

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.550
True. There’s so much to choose from.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.860
Using this product I bought off yamanso.com...

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.470
Note: True Love Story was a series of dating sims released for the Playstation and Playstation 2.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.470
I can enact my steamy onsen True Love Story with Mahiro-san!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.560
Note: The fourth iteration of the franchise is entitled: "True Love Story: Summer Days, and yet..."

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.560
Summer Days, and yet...!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:35.550
Goodbye to W
/Hello to the Confusingly Passionate Onsen

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:40.860
It’s a shame Yoichi-kun couldn’t join us here…

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.070
Yeah…

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:46.720
I tried inviting him, but apparently he had something going on he couldn’t miss.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.580
I’ll drill ya into swiss cheese!

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:57.660
Your Kung Fu could use some work, Nyaruko.

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:57.660
Take this, and that! And that!

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.840
We come to a resort, and <i>this</i>  is what they’re doing?

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.840
These places always have a game corner included.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:08.350
I’m just in awe at the pure amusement this world has to offer!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.230
I’m sure you are…

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.740
This is just the best…

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.820
Isn’t it gorgeous, Mahiro-kun?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:25.740
You bet!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.770
Maybe I’ll rematch you in a decade or so!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.700
Sniff…

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:06.300
You showed me no mercy despite my guard button being busted…

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:10.080
So I’m begging you… please take me under your wing, Nyaruko!

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.080
Cut it out!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.290
Go practice yourself!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:18.170
Every time she got close, all I could do was back away...

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.170
I’ve got my own things to focus on!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.170
Huh? Where’d those two go?

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.500
Maybe they hopped in the springs ahead of us?

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:37.260
This should just about do away with Mahiro-san’s super-steady poker face!

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.210
It’ll turn him into a king among playboys!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.020
Oh my, Mahiro-san!

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:55.450
You’re gonna give me third degree burns with that burning passion of yours!

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.580
<i>He’s here!</i>

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.590
<i>Come into the bath, and bathe me with your passion!</i>

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:09.340
<i>That’s right… Just a little more!</i>

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:12.800
The heck?!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.100
Kuuko?! Hasuta?!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.610
With our young hearts burning…

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:26.020
if we all become one, our passion will increase one million fold!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.110
C-Count me in!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.740
Just stay back, and stop glaring!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.740
Hold it right there!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.740
That’s enough from you two!

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:34.740
Nyaruko?!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:39.000
Why’d ya have to hop in the Passion Fruity bath I made for Mahiro-san?!

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.820
“Passion Fruity bath”...?

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:44.250
So you were just lurking in the shadows until I got in?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:48.260
And I thought I told you not to rely on your medicines!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.320
This doesn’t count as medicine!

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.260
It’s more like a bath salt!

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:57.020
This seems almost worse than most medicines!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:01.540
We’re finally at the onsen!
You can’t deny my expectations!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.650
And what <i>were</i>  you expecting…?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:07.040
This is a onsen! You musn’t deny me this!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.280
It’s so important, I said it twice.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:13.680
Note: This is a reference from Onsen Dragon Kingdom.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:13.680
You should try out my domain, it’s a great place!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.680
Cover yourself up!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.450
Nyaruko!

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:22.290
Let’s sail to a bubbly bobbly rainbow island together!

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:22.290
Would you get the heck off me?!

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:27.920
Mahiro-kun, I’ll wash your back for you…

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.420
and your front, if you’ll let me…

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.060
This bath hits the spot!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:48.360
Somehow they look much bigger without your clothes on.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.740
And I’m envious of your skin’s glow!

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.340
Oh my.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:08:00.860
You do have a point. These baths have been doing wonders for my skin.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:02.330
It’s like turning the clock back on aging…

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.400
I feel as fresh as I did at seventeen!

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:09.920
If you’re seventeen again, someone might swoon you!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.920
With a sweet smile…

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.340
you’ll capture the most hearts!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:23.340
Haiyore! Nyaruko-san W

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.950
And it took me so long to plan this for Mahiro-san too!

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:33.040
I’ll just have to use another of my onsen schemes!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.120
Peek.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:37.320
Well we <i>are</i>  at the onsen, after all.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.870
Would you quit it with that!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:44.100
I’d like to get all gaspy with Nyaruko in these baths!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.650
I wanna be with Mahiro-kun…

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.520
You guys need to stop it now!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.000
Let go of it already!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:51.960
I will not!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:52.880
Me neither!

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.020
What the heck’s going on?

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:05.760
What the–?!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.580
Hey, are you guys all right?!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:16.050
Hey, hey, hold on a sec!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.700
Why’d they have to multiply?!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.290
Mahiro-kun!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.500
You cannot escape us!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.290
We won’t let you!

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.660
Yasaka-kun?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.880
The bath of marriage, huh?

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:52.740
I wonder how it’s going with Nyaruko-chan and Yasaka-kun…

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:55.820
<i>Y-Yasaka-kun?!</i>

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.840
<i>What’s he doing</i>  here<i>?!</i>

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.700
We finally caught you!

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.680
What did I just see?!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.710
Maybe the heat’s getting to me…

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.730
Could it have been the bath’s blessing?

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:17.970
Give me a break…

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:21.360
You drag me to an onsen resort to <i>drain</i>  my energy?!

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:23.740
I’m sorry…

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.780
Forgive me…

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.420
It still hurts…

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:34.540
For crying out loud… the things they do...

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.740
Why not try hopping in the baths again?

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.100
That might be a good idea.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.010
This is what I wanted…

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.890
Nothing seems to be going my way…

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:11.900
All I wanted was to help take all of Mahiro-san’s troubles away…

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.480
<i>Nyaruko…</i>

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.620
Then stop dragging weird bath salts into it.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.650
Mahiro-san?!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.360
Sorry about that…

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:28.440
It’s just that our relationship isn’t making much progress…

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.640
I took it too far.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:39.670
This was just something… I thought we could have as a memory of us two…

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:06.450
It looks like… that happened after all.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:12.460
I was able to bathe with you in these springs…

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:22.540
Take a look!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.870
Summer’s just getting started, huh?

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.800
Mahiro-san… I love you!

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:55.870
Mahiro-san… I love you!

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:02.900
So… Mahiro-san…

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.740
What is it…?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:09.660
We were able to make such a beautiful memory like this, so…

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:16.000
Let’s continue on to the inevitable!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:19.620
Let’s interlock our destinies and release our desires!

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:20.550
Just shut up!

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:23.020
If we bathe together in this Babylicious Bath Water,

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:25.560
we might just have a child we can shower with love!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:31.100
Oh come on. There’s not a thing to worry about!

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.620
As long as I have my panties for tomorrow!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.680
Why you…

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.290
Uh, M-Mahiro-san?!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.960
All I did was confess my true feelings…

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:43.300
You gotta put words to your wants, right?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.820
Get ready for the fork…

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.060
Jab!

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:16.660
uchuu ni wa amata no hoshi ga aru kedo
There are countless stars in our universe,

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:24.170
watashi ni wa anata shika mou mienai
yet you're the only one I see.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:31.180
inryoku de hikitsukerare
I'll pull you in with my attractive force.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:39.140
kyohirarete mo tsuki no uragawa de zenryoku kikkutaan
Even in rejection, I'll come kicking through the dark side of the moon.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:43.040
koi wa moumoku to iimasu
They say love is blind,

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:46.610
iikaeru no nara kugitsuke
in other words, I want you to only see me.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:50.540
ikkyoshu ittousoku o
In the slightest way,

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:54.160
zutto mimamotteitai no
I want to watch over you.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.080
koi to sekyuriti ryouritsu
Love and security go hand-in-hand.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.670
itsumo issho nara daijoubu
As long as we're together, there's nothing to fear.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:05.420
anata no hitomi burakku hooru
Your eye is like a black hole...

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:10.860
ochinai kyuuinryoku S.O.S.
I'm being sucked in and sending out an S.O.S.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:18.980
daisuki desu. yotte S.O.S.
I'm so in love. So I send out this S.O.S.
